# Dashing Bloodsucker: "Eerie - Whenever an enchantment you control enters and whenever you fully unlock a Room, this creature
# gets +2/+0 and gains lifelink until end of turn." Bot1 casts the 2/5 Bloodsucker in turn 1 (a creature, not an enchantment:
# no trigger; Power 2, no keyword). In turn 3 it casts Roaring Furnace, the Room entering (CR 603.6a) with one door unlocked, which is
# one enchantment entering and not a full unlock: Power 4, Toughness still 5, Lifelink, and it attacks for 4 (Bot2 20 -> 16)
# while Bot1 gains 4 (20 -> 24, CR 702.15b). In turn 5 it unlocks Steaming Sauna, fully unlocking the Room (the 2024-09-20
# ruling): +2 once more (Power 4 again, not 6, which would show the cast had triggered twice), another 4 damage and 4 life.

